{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/837036-pilgrim-gens-du-voyage","id":837036,"title":"Pilgrim: gens du voyage.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-25T08:15:06-08:00","id":837036,"title":"Pilgrim: gens du voyage.","content":"I have been thinking about the creation of a... faction for WoD. It is a bloodline of travelers or nomands with old links (and hate-love relations) with the rest of supernatural creatures.<br /> <br /> (Have you seen the movie &quot;Nomads&quot; with Pierce Brosman?).<br /> <br /> Its origin isn't the north of India (or at least only a family tree). They have been allies, or slaves, of supernatural creatures, with blood from fay and werebeats ancestors. The most family tree is from a slave army by Vlad Tempest Drakul. <br /> <br /> * Rumanian and Egyptian are some of their nicknames, or keynames. A family tree really is from ancient Egypt. They would rather the name &quot;Numidians&quot; (ancient people who were Carthago's neighbour). <br /> <br /> * Today maybe they are talisman traders for supernatural creatures, for example a magic blade for a vampire to drink blood without bitting. In the past, teorically, they were allowed to travel to the &quot;other realms&quot; for trade. <br /> <br /> * They are travelling becuase they are running way, a &quot;mysterious&quot; power is chasing them from long time ago, and they are a special prey for supernatural predators/slavedrivers. The &quot;nomad's&quot; blood and flesh is special and used by supernatural creatures. <br /> <br /> * They knows the secrets about the gates toward the &quot;specolaspheres&quot; or &quot;nebulapolis&quot;, places like a mixture of spirit courts, mages' horizon realms and alternative timelines, ruled by &quot;Deucalion's children, the titanblood&quot;. <br /> <br /> * They are known among the supernatural creatures like (supernatural political) advicers and spies with the (ethnic) fortune-teller like cover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T10:55:13-08:00","id":837092,"title":"","content":"Ah so it's the sanitized version of your snowflake society that's trying really hard to dance around the &quot;G&quot; word.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T11:10:11-08:00","id":837104,"title":"","content":"I try to be &quot;politically correct&quot; because I don't wish this thread to be closed and erasured. <br /> <br /> * In my idea the &quot;prigrims&quot; can travell to another &quot;Brigadoon&quot;, a pocket universe with different versions of WoD, for example a zombie apocalypse where the walking deads are food for the werebeasts, or a dystopian ruled by vampires, or a savage world where fays and ghosts fight to colonise the unexplored land.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-05T10:49:42-08:00","id":842641,"title":"","content":"I have got more ideas. <br /> <br /> * Habiru is the name of a &quot;bloodline&quot; whose origin was the ancient near Orient. With Alexander the Great they travelled to the India... and centuries later they travelles to the west. A group was hired by Vlad &quot;Dracul&quot; Tepes when he was alive... and later like vampire.<br /> <br /> * The Neil Gaiman's work &quot;Neverwhere&quot; (novel, teleserie and comic) has gave me some idea about a mirror universe, pocket universe or Umbra Realm. <br /> <br /> * In the past they were &quot;pets&quot; of supernatural creatures used like status symbols.<br /> <br /> * The origin of a &quot;bloodline&quot; is Deucalion, son of mythological Prometheus (who stole the fire to give it to humanity).<br /> <br /> * Some &quot;pilgrims&quot; suffer a strange curse.. sometime they wake up with a different identity (but same body and memories) in a different place, usually a alternative timeline, for example a zombie post-apocalipse . This curse allows to discover a possible future could be changed. <br /> <br /> * Other group can travel to a strange spirit realm, but this has got a special curse. All artificial tool from exterior are broken fastly.. and they you have to use the tools to craft new item. Artificial item created with material from savage lands has got a normal life. Pre- steam motor technology is possible, and the most advanced is a wind or water mill. The &quot;savage lands&quot; are the home of hostile ratkin (wererats).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T11:49:11-08:00","id":846197,"title":"","content":"Disclaimer:<br /> <br /> I am from South Spain, Andalucia, where Gipsy commutiny is more mixed with naives. Here where I live it's maybe the place with less antiziganism.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> I feel a great wish to add an urban fantasy style, but it should be enought gothic-punk to be used with the rest of WoD. To add something like the Metropolis from &quot;Kult: divinity lost&quot; is also too hard. <br /> <br /> * There origin is a (mythical) cosmopolitan city where different supernatural creatures lived together almost peacefully. The city was attacked by enemies and suvivors, from all races and social classes, ran away. This city would be in Prester John's kingdom, in far orient. Part of these residents were from Persia and Egypt. Other group were blackskin slaves from Houssa and Zeruzura (mythical African cities).<br /> <br /> * There is some reasons to be preys and predators, for example a bloodline could kill garou kindred to become like werewolves, but not true garous.<br /> <br /> * Somebody can travel to special demiplanes or pocket universes to trade or to colonize. One of them it is a post-apocalypse megapolis with meneater giants, the laestrygonians... (the younger brothers of &quot;Attack of the titans&quot; manga/anime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T12:47:51-07:00","id":942930,"title":"","content":"I had tought about to create a new thread, but maybe it is better to reanimate this.<br /> <br /> * I have got some ideas about my &quot;pilgrims&quot; and background, but I need time to translate them to English languange.<br /> <br /> * I have seen in the bookshop a new serie of novels, the saga &quot;Stravaganzza&quot; about young people who travel to a alternative XVI Italy, where names are different. That has been source of inspiration to imagine a WoD version of Stravaganza franchise, where the world-travellers would be gypsy-like nomads.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stravaganza_(series\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stravaganza_(series</a>)<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> <br /> The background about the origin of the &quot;pilgrims&quot; would be Indian city Kannauj, a &quot;supernatural cosmopolis&quot; where different creatures lived together (maybe in a realm of Horizon or pocke universe). In the XI century suffered a siege (by Mahmud of Gazni) and its citizens, from different races, went to exile. They traveled until sultanate of Rum. They mixed with refugees from another lands, and they were for a time until Baba Ishak started the BaBai revolt. Then the prigrilms, a half-blood community traveled to the West, Europe, with new bloodlines from another lost cities (Houssa, Zerzura, from Africa, Ubar, capital of A'ad, the Atlantis from the sands).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":11152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","user":"Luis Carlos","date":".  Adding. 08-03-2016, 04:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}